# Snapdragon X (Surface Laptop 7). Curated firmware (live-build's firmware auto-install
# is off for this profile); trixie-backports has the X1E80100 files (trixie's are older).
# Adreno X1-85 (gen70500 SQE/GMU, the generic zap shader), QUP serial engines, the
# Romulus audio topology:
firmware-qcom-soc/trixie-backports
# WCN7850 Wi-Fi (ath12k) and Bluetooth (qca):
firmware-atheros/trixie-backports
firmware-linux-free
# Qualcomm IPC router tools for the remote processors (ADSP: audio, battery, USB-C)
qrtr-tools
# Copying the laptop's own firmware from the Windows drivers (msiextract, cabextract)
msitools
cabextract
# Hardware testing on the laptop: input devices, device tree, Wi-Fi, sensors
libinput-tools
evtest
device-tree-compiler
iw
lm-sensors
dmidecode
